#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:94 8ec34d9dff134972899bff440cf947ce
msgid "1. 训练任务提交与实时监控"
msgstr "1\\. Job Submission and Live Monitoring"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:96 75aa132072d249c58c4fe7d44c1ce563
msgid "**任务提交**："
msgstr "**Job Submission**:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:97 5b6ee396b22b40b2aa17fcb0b6092487
msgid "下拉框选择目标模型，系统动态同步所有支持的模型列表。"
msgstr ""
"Select target models from a dropdown dynamically synchronized with "
"supported models."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:98 bad22fdecc6347a0ae94f82b18e83c91
msgid "选择预处理好的数据集与 K 折折数。"
msgstr "Select preprocessed datasets and cross-validation fold counts."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:99 3f92b8225ab74e7781404acebc0c0e68
msgid "模型专属超参数表单会根据该模型的 `ModelConfig` 动态渲染，附带默认值与取值范围校验。"
msgstr ""
"Model-specific hyperparameter forms render dynamically based on "
"`ModelConfig`, with default values and validation rules."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:100
#: fb5e184d6e294b878d237df0d7db26bd
msgid "支持配置早停监控指标、随机种子、确定性算法及 GPU 设备编号。"
msgstr ""
"Configure early stopping metrics, seeds, deterministic algorithms, and "
"GPU device IDs."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:101
#: cd66a1b012964dc48fb18b99883d1c43
msgid "**任务列表与状态看板**："
msgstr "**Job Queue and Status Board**:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:102
#: 7bf51838298e437c8b2648dc6f78b311
msgid "集中展示所有处于排队、运行、完成或失败状态的任务看板。"
msgstr ""
"Centralized dashboard displaying jobs in queued, running, completed, or "
"failed states."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:103
#: a2432742e89f4856b1f3a417466f9fbf
msgid "**实时日志流**："
msgstr "**Real-Time Log Streaming**:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:104
#: dd694728409b43518782d3da5f672d4a
msgid "点击任意任务进入详情页，通过 WebSocket 实时接收终端输出，无需登录服务器。"
msgstr ""
"Click any job to stream live terminal logs over WebSocket without needing"
" SSH access."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:105
#: 9e4a1c9a6b644decbb41315eabcde721
msgid "支持对运行中的任务执行一键终止，或对异常中断的任务重新运行。"
msgstr "Cancel running jobs with one click or re-run failed tasks instantly."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:107
#: 8f3ef153478c45a0a180ed9b3409ff15
msgid "2. 超参数搜索管理"
msgstr "2\\. Hyperparameter Search Management"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:109
#: 715409d83c1448a08aa4bd9a4fc26425
msgid "**创建搜索试验**："
msgstr "**Create Search Studies**:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:110
#: bcf5554b8194416e86010343fd060c18
#, python-brace-format
msgid "选择模型与数据集后，系统自动列出该模型 `metadata={'optuna': ...}` 声明的所有可搜索参数及其上下界。"
msgstr ""
"After choosing a model and dataset, the UI lists all tunable parameters "
"and bounds declared in `metadata={'optuna': ...}`."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:111
#: a829a546d67041469db50f0ee6cd8ed9
msgid "配置试验总数、TPE 或 NSGA-II 采样算法，以及中位数或百分位数剪枝策略。"
msgstr ""
"Configure trial counts, TPE or NSGA-II sampling, and median/percentile "
"pruners."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:112
#: 253696af138b42e29b84112d87df45a6
msgid "**交互式试验可视化**："
msgstr "**Interactive Study Visualizations**:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:113
#: 8c5f232da3db41e4a371768f47361d1a
msgid "动态展示各 Trial 的优化目标收敛折线图。"
msgstr "Visualize real-time optimization convergence curves across trials."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:114
#: de7cc5f09d97416197944fe98b93179a
msgid "超参数对目标指标的相关性权重分析。"
msgstr "Parameter importance rankings and correlation weight analyses."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:115
#: a0d58b41b469499380d1cb877845496e
msgid "支持导出最优超参数字典，并直接从界面一键生成重跑任务。"
msgstr ""
"Export optimal hyperparameter dictionaries and launch reproduction runs "
"directly."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:117
#: 6cc05b6d8beb45e0a019c1e51fed30a1
msgid "3. 数据集预处理面板"
msgstr "3\\. Dataset Preprocessing Panel"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:119
#: 4316eebaaf5745558ca6a7067ba6d977
msgid "**数据集全局清单**："
msgstr "**Global Dataset Inventory**:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:120
#: cc619d637f674cf1bef7791094c50778
msgid ""
"查看 UniKT 支持的 15 个标准数据集处理器，涵盖 ASSISTments 系列、EdNet-KT1、Junyi2015、KDD Cup "
"2010 与 XES3G5M 等。"
msgstr ""
"View the 15 standard dataset processors supported by UniKT, covering the "
"ASSISTments series, EdNet-KT1, Junyi2015, KDD Cup 2010, XES3G5M, and "
"more."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:121
#: 245396aad0754a4082a10bb7fd332180
msgid "显示每个数据集的下载状态、处理状态及磁盘占用大小。"
msgstr ""
"Displays download status, preprocessing status, and disk footprints for "
"each dataset."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:122
#: 366ad5d194634ff18005718bfaa8db3d
msgid "**一键下载与流水线处理**："
msgstr "**One-Click Download and Pipeline Execution**:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:123
#: b54cbe2f39a24a3dbe34f5064a7c5240
msgid "支持从内置镜像一键拉取数据集，亦可对已就绪的本地数据直接执行预处理。"
msgstr ""
"Supports one-click download for datasets with built-in mirrors, or running "
"the preprocessing pipeline directly on prepared local data."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:124
#: 063c720e5eb943c79e45f86fb9d3566c
msgid "点击“处理”按钮触发自动化清洗、题目与知识点映射，以及 5 折 Parquet 序列生成。"
msgstr ""
"Click \"Process\" to trigger automated cleaning, entity mappings, and "
"5-fold Parquet generation."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:125
#: f6426d866a9b438a870affab3deb291d
msgid "界面实时显示预处理流水线进度条与状态反馈。"
msgstr "Real-time pipeline progress bars and step-by-step telemetry feedback."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:127
#: 65a23ce544cf4c4c88c0de55a6991be0
msgid "4. 硬件与系统资源监控"
msgstr "4\\. Hardware and System Resource Telemetry"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:129
#: 372997eccfe64ba48767a2b769be1b12
msgid "**实时 GPU 仪表盘**："
msgstr "**Real-Time GPU Dashboard**:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:130
#: ec054583b11142f3ad541c99f2ef79fc
msgid "检测系统中所有可用的 NVIDIA GPU 设备。"
msgstr "Detects all available NVIDIA GPU devices in the system."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:131
#: d5b7c73e32c044c688dfb1a2f19f94bc
msgid "实时绘制各 GPU 的计算核心利用率、显存占用量及当前温度。"
msgstr "Plots core compute utilization, VRAM usage, and temperatures in real time."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:132
#: 06d5969124d14ad598e34b9972c64ff5
msgid "**主机系统资源动态**："
msgstr "**Host System Metrics**:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:133
#: 6eb76f1dd048427bb2cb6a761ddd7523
msgid "监控主机 CPU 总体占用率与每个核心的负载分布。"
msgstr "Monitors aggregate host CPU usage and per-core load distributions."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:134
#: 6ea4aa1240a54130a31a902a911d24bb
msgid "系统 RAM 物理内存使用水位曲线。"
msgstr "Real-time physical RAM memory usage curves."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:135
#: 10dddda008b749f297402dee99879e23
msgid "帮助实验人员及时排查由于 DataLoader `num_workers` 过多导致的内存泄漏或 CPU 瓶颈。"
msgstr ""
"Helps researchers identify memory leaks or CPU bottlenecks caused by "
"excessive DataLoader `num_workers`."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:137
#: f25d171d3e224b4185bc914fa0f6447f
msgid "预期验证与问题排查"
msgstr "Verification and Troubleshooting"

